{"symbol":"WORKMATES","yahoo":"WORKMATES.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"sme":null,"name":"Workmates Core2Cloud Solution Limited","sector":"Technology","industry":"Information Technology Services","website":"https://cloudworkmates.com","about":"Workmates Core2Cloud Solution Limited operates as a cloud managed services company that focuses on Amazon Web Services (AWS). The company provides cloud consulting, such as cloud infra provisioning, load balancing and firewall, managed services, cloud environment optimization and data migration services; data and AI services, including data engineering, advanced analytics, and generative ai solutions; resilience services, comprising business operations resilience, cyber resilience, disaster recovery and business continuity; cloud modernization; and cybersecurity services, such as red teaming services, blue teaming services, managed security services (MSS), cyber range-based simulation services, cloud security services, and compliance and risk governance services. It also offers cloud management services; AWS MSP services; and business solutions, including business process re-engineering, business process architecture, blueprint and SOPs, and business solution consulting services. Im addition, the company provides Microsoft workloads on AWS, tally on AWS cloud, AWS media solutions, SAP on AWS, FlickOtt, proprietary solutions, and SMB solutions. It serves industries, such as financial services, manufacturing and logistics, media and entertainment, retail and e-commerce, healthcare and life sciences, and IT. Workmates Core2Cloud Solution Limited was formerly known as Workmates Core2Cloud Solution Private Limited and changed its name to Workmates Core2Cloud Solution Limited in January 2025. The company was incorporated in 2018 and is based in Kolkata, India.","updated":"2026-10-01T12:24:29+00:00","quote":{"price":371.45,"prevClose":391.0,"marketCap":479.87,"high52":514.0,"low52":264.0,"pe":25.81,"bookValue":72.67,"dividendRate":4.0,"